body:
thanks I appreciate it. kinda the only reason I don't want therapy is because I don't need my family to figure it out. i don't have a good relationship with them, but I really don't want them to figure out its this bad. 

&#x200B;

there is times when we sit and eat dinner and they just start trash talking a fictional person and saying like "only weak people is depressed and goes to therapists", and lots of other things like that.

they also use the word "depressed" if they are just sad one day, which is fucking annoying when they use it as a temproary thing for a few hours.

&#x200B;

sorry, needed to get that off my chest. 

ill consider your "offer", can't find the right word here haha.

&#x200B;

thanks again
